# Blood of Heroes (crystalWar 52) at the Forbidding Portal beside What Price Loyalty (group 5, its Prog 3 reply the
# Progress 9; Blood's Prog 2 reply the Progress 4). A level 99 Warrior in Xarcabard [S]; Songbirds in a Snowstorm
# and Beneath the Mask completed, both quests accepted by GMs. Blood at Prog 2 and What Price Loyalty at Prog 3 with the
# Commander's Endorsement: the two Progress replies tie, so the first takes container order and the rotation var is
# written (two ties), so the next tie plays the other. Without the endorsement What Price Loyalty has no section
# (Blood's 4 alone). Blood at Prog 3 (no reply of its own): What Price Loyalty's 9 alone, finished: its Prog 4.
